# search resources

## 200

### search existing file by full name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=TZ.md

### search by partial name (substring match)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=TZ

### search case-insensitive (uppercase query)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=tz

### search folder by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=documents

### search by partial folder name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=doc

### search with no matches - return empty list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=xyznotexist123

### search with single character
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=a

### search file with extension only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=.txt

## 400

### missing query param
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search

### empty query param
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=

### blank query (spaces only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=%20%20

# move / rename resource

## 200

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="report.txt"

< ../src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### rename file in root (only name changes)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=report.txt&to=report_v2.txt

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=source/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=archive/

### move folder into another folder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=source/&to=archive/source/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=source/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=source/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="data.txt"

< ../src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### move file from one folder to another
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=source/data.txt&to=archive/data.txt

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=a/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=a/b/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=a/b/c/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=a/b/c/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="deep.txt"

< ../src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### rename deeply nested folder — nested content must be preserved
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=a/b/&to=a/b_renamed/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=my-files_backup/

### rename folder with dashes and underscores
