###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=inbox/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=inbox/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="note.txt"

< ../src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### move file from nested folder up to root
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=inbox/note.txt&to=note.txt

##  400

### from param is missing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?to=archive/report.txt

### to param is missing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=report.txt

### both params missing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move

### from is root "/"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=/&to=archive/

### to is root "/"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=docs/&to=/

### from is empty string
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=&to=archive/

### to is empty string
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=docs/&to=

### path traversal in from
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=../etc/passwd&to=safe.txt

### path traversal in to
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=docs/report.txt&to=../etc/pass.txt

### only slashes in from
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=///&to=archive/

### type mismatch: from=folder/, to=file (no trailing slash) — 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=mismatch-folder/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="mismatch-file.txt"

< ../src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### folder -> file path: type mismatch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=mismatch-folder/&to=mismatch-file.txt

### file -> folder path: type mismatch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=mismatch-file.txt&to=mismatch-folder/

## 404

### from file does not exist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=ghost.txt&to=ghost_v2.txt

### from folder does not exist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=ghost/&to=ghost_renamed/

### parent path of to does not exist (one level)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=note.txt&to=non-existent-parent/note.txt

### parent path of to does not exist (deep hierarchy)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource/move?from=note.txt&to=x/y/z/note.txt

